{"ID":"20230927141402-0izg731","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927141402-0izg731","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927141402-0izg731\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927141415-p4702ss\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927141415-mp6yczf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927141415-mp6yczf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:77,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:77\u0026#125;","title":"【瓜蒂散】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927141415"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927141415-p4702ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927141415-p4702ss","updated":"20230927141415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂散方：瓜蒂一分（熬）、赤小豆一分；"}]},{"ID":"20230927141415-mp6yczf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927141415-mp6yczf","updated":"20230927141415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右三味，各别捣筛，为散已，合治之，取一钱匙，以香豉一合，用热汤七合，煮作稀糜，去滓，取汁，和散，温顿服之，不吐者，少少加，得快吐乃止。诸亡血虚家，不可与。"}]}]}